# Flow — AI Advisor configuration (optional)
#
# Flow's AI Advisor is narration-only: it explains and risk-flags the tweaks
# Flow's own hardware-matching logic has already selected. It never chooses
# which tweaks run — that stays pinned to TWEAK_DATABASE, same as always.
#
# You do NOT need this file. With nothing filled in, the "AI Insight"
# button in the GUI just stays hidden and everything else works exactly
# as before.
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to ".env" (same folder as flow.py).
#   2. Replace the placeholder text after the "=" on ONE of the lines below
#      with your real key. Leave the rest exactly as they are.
#   3. Save. That's it — flow.py loads .env automatically on every launch
#      (via _load_dotenv(), near the top of the file). No shell exports,
#      no restart tricks, no extra install step.
#
# Every provider Flow supports is listed below, already uncommented. You
# don't need to delete or comment out the ones you're not using — Flow
# recognizes unfilled placeholder text (anything still containing
# "your_..._here") and ignores those lines automatically. Fill in as many
# as you actually have keys for; if more than one is filled in, Flow uses
# them in the order listed here (Groq first).
#
# A key set as a real environment variable (e.g. via your shell profile)
# always takes precedence over the matching line in .env, if both exist.
#
# Prefer the GUI instead? Click the gear icon (top-right of Flow) and paste
# a key there — same auto-provider-detection, saved to
# ~/.flow/ai_config.json instead of this file. Either path works.

# Groq — https://console.groq.com/keys — genuinely free tier, recommended
# default for a zero-budget setup.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Gemini — https://aistudio.google.com/api-keys — genuinely free tier
# (no card required), generous quota on the Flash model Flow uses by default.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here

# OpenRouter — https://openrouter.ai/keys — free via the "openrouter/free"
# auto-router (always resolves to whatever free model is currently live,
# so it won't 404 when a specific free model gets deprecated), good
# zero-budget alternative.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here

# OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys — paid, no free tier.
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_key_here

# Anthropic — https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys — paid, no free tier.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_key_here

# Advanced / fallback only — leave this one commented out unless you're on
# some other OpenAI-compatible provider not listed above. Flow will still
# try to sniff which provider it is from the key's prefix.
# FLOW_AI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Optional per-provider model overrides — only needed if a default below
# ever goes stale again (deprecated/decommissioned) before this file gets
# updated, or if you just prefer a different model than Flow's default.
# FLOW_MODEL_GROQ=openai/gpt-oss-20b
# FLOW_MODEL_GEMINI=gemini-2.5-flash
# FLOW_MODEL_OPENROUTER=openrouter/free
# FLOW_MODEL_OPENAI=gpt-5-mini
# FLOW_MODEL_ANTHROPIC=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
